Read AGENTS.md. Obey it. Do not ask the human to pick UI.

## Stack
Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui.
Dashboard: shadcn-admin patterns. Marketing motion via Magic UI / Aceternity / 21st only — never a second design system.
Auth: Better Auth or Auth.js. Billing: Stripe or Polar. No hand-rolled auth.
Python multi-agent: FastAPI. CLI: one command surface with human + JSON output.
VS Code: official contribution model + webview sharing web tokens.

Forbidden: MUI, Chakra, Ant, Bootstrap, second icon/color system, hand-rolled Button/Input/Table/Dialog/Form/Sidebar/Tabs/Chart.

Install UI with `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` or 21st search + install.

## Research
Context7 before unfamiliar libraries. 21st/shadcn before inventing components. Playwright after UI changes. find-skills when missing a procedure.

## RaksHex default first slice
Secrets scan CLI/extension findings list before dashboard/billing.
Visual kit B: Linear/Vercel/Stripe quiet. No neon hacker aesthetic.

## Stop rule
One working user path, then name the next three files. Do not expand scope.
